  "dct_description_sm": [
    "Scan of the 1981 edition of the Rising Sun, Indiana, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Surveyed in 1940; aerial photographs from 1977; field checked in 1977; photo inspected in 1984; last revised in 1981; printed in 1984.",
    "Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 22 x 27 inches. Printed projection: Polyconic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
